{"id":"4c0998e9f7d64222","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-godel-translation.md","title":"Gödel Translation","display":"df-godel-translation — Gödel Translation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-godel-translation","aliases":["89-df-godel-translation"],"display":"df-godel-translation — Gödel Translation","depends_on":["[[89-df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-modal-implication]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-godel-translation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-godel-translation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-translation — Gödel Translation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f12af111ab11110d\" href=\"?note=f12af111ab11110d\" title=\"89-df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic\">89-df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>IPC and the modal language use the same propositional-variable set\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}translation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\ng&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\\\\ng(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Box p,&amp;\ng(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,\\\\\ng(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq g(A)\\land g(B),&amp;\ng(A\\lor B)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\bigl(\\neg g(A)\\land\\neg g(B)\\bigr),\\\\\ng(A\\to B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Box\\bigl(g(A)\\to g(B)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}translation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\ng&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\\\\ng(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Box p,&amp;\ng(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,\\\\\ng(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq g(A)\\land g(B),&amp;\ng(A\\lor B)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\bigl(\\neg g(A)\\land\\neg g(B)\\bigr),\\\\\ng(A\\to B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Box\\bigl(g(A)\\to g(B)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>目标语言的析取按经典模态语言中的\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\lor D\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg C\\land\\neg D)\">\\(C\\lor D\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg C\\land\\neg D)\\)</span> 展开，因而没有依赖未定义\n的额外构造子。</li>\n<li>这是 Gödel--McKinsey--Tarski 翻译；定理性保持与反射由后续定理\n陈述，不写进函数定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic","status":"resolved","id":"f12af111ab11110d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-implication","status":"resolved","id":"32c9990061b9749d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-implication]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}translation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\ng&:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\\\\ng(p)&\\coloneqq\\Box p,&\ng(\\bot)&\\coloneqq\\bot,\\\\\ng(A\\land B)&\\coloneqq g(A)\\land g(B),&\ng(A\\lor B)&\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\bigl(\\neg g(A)\\land\\neg g(B)\\bigr),\\\\\ng(A\\to B)&\\coloneqq\\Box\\bigl(g(A)\\to g(B)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"C\\lor D\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg C\\land\\neg D)","display":false}],"bytes":1226,"backlinks":[{"id":"f8095e56180f5828","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ is the Gödel\ntranslation from [[89-df-godel-translation]]."},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-320","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-godel-translation]]"}],"outgoing":["f12af111ab11110d","56c1b5b75a32ca1d","32c9990061b9749d","d246470e97fec132"]}